Spécialisations
Logistique
Recrutement Et Sélection
Pas défini
A Bachelor’s Degree in Logistic and transport or in any equivalent technical discipline;
At least 3 years of relevant working experience. Professional training in various capacities and industries;
Good technical knowledge of the material/services required, good negotiating and communications skills; high moral and ethical standards as well as the ability to work independently;
Unquestionable integrity and reliability;
Attention to detail;
Focused and self-motivated;
Perfectly bi-lingual French & English – Spoken and written;
Highly competent with Microsoft Office suite – Particularly Excel and Word;

